OL,3,GNEWSACancer survivor with a stoma says
OL,4,Ahe was made to feel like a 'criminal'
OL,5,Aat airports
OL,6,
OL,7,FNow, a charity wants better training
OL,8,Ffor airport staff so people with stomas
OL,9,Fare treated with "dignity" and
OL,10,F"respect".
OL,12,FThe UK Civil Aviation Authority (CAA)
OL,13,Fsaid airports must ensure staff have
OL,14,Fdisability awareness training and that
OL,15,Fsecurity officers were expected to
OL,16,Ftreat people in a "sensitive and
OL,17,Funderstanding" way.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
